    "name": "Vista Test API",
    "description": "## Vista Technical Test – Backend API\n\nREST API for managing companies and their services.  \nBuilt with Node.js, TypeScript, Express, Prisma and MySQL.\n\n### Getting started\n\n1. Run the backend (see README.md in the repo).\n    \n2. Set the `baseUrl` collection variable to your server address (default `http://localhost:3000`).\n    \n\n### Endpoints\n\n| Method | Endpoint | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| POST | `/companies` | Create a company |\n| GET | `/companies` | List all companies with their services |\n| POST | `/services` | Create a service under a company |\n| GET | `/services/:id` | Get service details by ID |\n\n### Status codes\n\n- **200** OK / **201** Created\n    \n- **400** Validation failed (response lists each invalid field)\n    \n- **404** Company or service not found\n    \n- **409** Registration number already exists\n    \n- **500** Internal server error",
